WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
 

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:09.140
Very few monsters in film and other media are quite as prevelant as zombies. And with good reason.

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:12.620
With so many more plausible disasters looming around the corner

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:15.220
such as war, climate change and financial ruin

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:17.800
zombies offer a greedy escape into a future

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.855
that ,while maybe scary, we know to be fiction.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.940
On the one hand some small part of us is terrified

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:26.440
that a zombie apocalypse could be possible.

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:28.940
But on the other hand many of us hope for it.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.060
Decades of zombie movies and video games have given

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.580
preppers and would-be zombie hunters the information

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.040
to prepare for the inevidable rising of the dead.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.560
But likely is it that we can actually make it out alive?

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:43.720
What would it take to survive a zombie apocalypse?

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.800
The first things that probably come to mind

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:49.560
are guns, baseball bats and giant ridiculous tracks with push-bumpers.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.300
And while these things are definitely valuable tools,

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.820
if you have to use them, you're probably in the worst case scenario,

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:57.600
or you're just reckless.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.740
And either way, you probably won't last long.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:03.180
What every survivor really needs to focus on is

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:06.020
the least glamorous aspect of the post-apocalyptic life.

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:09.280
Have seasonal allergies? Make sure you have zyrtec on hand.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.320
Or risk getting chumped up by zombies who heard you sneezing.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:15.005
Allergic to bees? Stock up on eppen pills.

00:01:15.005 --> 00:01:16.720
Unless you want to be that one loser

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.280
who died from a bee sting instead a horde of living dead.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.140
There are a lot of little details to take into consideration

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:24.540
when trying to survive any apocalypse.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:28.140
The first and most obvious necessities would be clean drinking water,

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:30.320
food and general first aid.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:33.240
As a rule of thumb, each member of your party should drink about

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:36.000
one gallon of water per day due to the physical exertion

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:38.200
required to exist in a world of revenant zombies.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.000
That can add up quickly.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.380
So make sure you have a way to collect fresh water

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:44.560
either through purifying existing water sources

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:46.580
or desalinating ocean water.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:50.320
The average human can only go about 3 days to a week without water.

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:52.440
So regardless of your survival skills

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:55.340
having drinking water in adundance is non-negotiable.

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:57.640
Food is still critical but more managable.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:00.780
While a lack of food can lead to decreased physical fortitude,

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.340
the average human can survive

00:02:02.345 --> 00:02:05.835
up to three weeks without food as long as they have plenty of water.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:08.700
Finally, first aid supplies like bandages

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:11.380
hyrogen-peroxide and any needed prescription drugs

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:14.800
will be a life saver when someone in your party inevidably hurts themselves.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:17.580
A gash from a rusty nail can be just as deadly as

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:19.940
zombie bite if not treated quickly.

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:23.140
Then there are the every useful utility item we all use in everyday life.

00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:26.540
Ducktape alone has more uses than you would ever expect.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.640
From securing barricades to restraining hostile humans

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:32.780
to attaching knives to (?) for extra zombie killing reach.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:36.220
Pocket knives are multitools we find uses as well.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:39.860
Such as sharpening sticks, (?) restraints or opening cans of food.

00:02:40.820 --> 00:02:42.080
Then there are flash lights.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:45.245
Many of us have gotten so used to having a flash light app on our phones

00:02:45.245 --> 00:02:48.600
that we forget to keep a real, more powerful flash light handy.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.660
When your phone eventually dies, and there is no power available,

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:53.600
having a flash light could be the difference

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:55.780
between life and death when traveling at night.

00:02:56.125 --> 00:02:58.805
As for transportation, while a car or a truck

00:02:58.805 --> 00:03:01.240
might offer decent protection from the zombies outside,

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:03.600
the engine noise will also attract their attention

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.060
and potentially lead them to your hiding spot.

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.880
Act for something quiet and more maneuverable, like a bike.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:12.520
Or if you intend on using a car, steal somebody's Tesla.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:15.585
Just be prepared when the power sources stop working.

00:03:15.585 --> 00:03:18.140
So you 've got your supplies, and you're on the move.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:20.840
Looking for somewhere safe to set up a base of operations.

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:24.675
Step 1: locate a mall, then don't go there.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:27.380
Places where large amounts of people can congregate

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.720
are the perfect breeding ground for zombies.

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:33.215
And closed areas with large crowds make for easy infection.

00:03:33.215 --> 00:03:35.995
And with all the people instinctively rushing to malls and grocery stores

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.120
to stock up on supplies, they're the last place you want to be.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.940
Instead head for more isolated areas.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:45.820
Your first option and potentially the safest place near the average person

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.480
would be a tall highway overpass or bridge.

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.120
If you could card enough supplies onto the bridge,

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.720
building materials, food, maybe even farming implement soil and seeds,

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.080
your party could destroy both ends of the bridge

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:59.860
and effectively seperate yourselves from the dangers below.

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.760
The biggest risk here would be running out of supplies

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:06.360
as it would be very difficult to go out and scavenge and get back up.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:10.440
Another option would be a large boat or yatch crewed by people you trust.

00:04:10.820 --> 00:04:15.820
Most zombie lords suggest that the living dead would be unable to swim due to their ruined motor functions.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:21.500
As long as you're in deep enough water, you would be completely isolated from zombies and most of humanity as well.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:25.460
The biggest problem with using a modern boat is their need for fuel.

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:27.800
If you run out of gas, you're dead in the water.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.540
So if you decide to set up an aquatic base of operations,

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.420
make sure you have as much fuel as you can possibly carry.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:37.120
Two other hiding places that could become an option thanks to your boat

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:40.520
would be small uninhabited islands and offshore oil rigs.

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:44.040
A private island would be ideal for those with enough survival experience

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.320
to build shelter, rain capture devices and traps to catch wild animals,

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:50.420
and any hostile humans who show up looking for a fight.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.520
Your party would have plenty of space to spread out depending

00:04:53.520 --> 00:04:55.480
on the size of the island. And the odds of zombies

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.235
showing up on your beach are virtually  zero.

00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:00.340
If you can find an uninhabited island far enough

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:03.100
from other land and people, you can survive the end of

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.440
the world in a relative comfort.

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.900
Finally, a deep sea oil rig is an ideal spot

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.660
to wait out the zombie apocalypse.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:11.620
You would be miles from the nearest land,

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:16.460
suspended well above the water level, have plenty of existing near-indestructable metal shelter

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.240
and ,provided you have fishing equipment,

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:21.480
you've got an endless supply of food at your fingertips.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:23.440
For those of us who don't fancy the idea of

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.680
building shelter from scratch on a remote island

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:27.840
and value the security of a floating fortress,

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.140
a deep sea oil rig is the way to go.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.560
Of course, by choosing any of these isolated

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.440
hiding spots, you limit your ability to gather news

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.140
and information from the main land

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:38.420
,which means you need to make sure

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:40.660
you have a radio or some other form of communication

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:44.340
with the outside world to know when it is safe to come home if ever.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:47.020
Could the human race recover from a zombie outbreak?

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:50.460
Possibly. With the military and the centre for disease control

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:53.000
working together, it's hard to imagine a scenario

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:56.480
where mindless monsters eradicate the entire human race.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:58.840
But it doesn't hurt to be prepared, and make sure

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.500
you don't become part of the horde.

